    "title": "Palm Sunday 2026 date. When Holy Week begins",
    "text": "RELIGIONWhen is Palm Sunday? When Holy Week begins Jenna PrestininziDetroit Free PressMarch 23, 2026, 10:06 a.m. ETSubscribe to hear this storyChristians throughout Michigan will soon observe Palm Sunday, ushering in the start of Holy Week.Palm Sunday is Sunday, March 29, the final Lenten Sunday ahead of Easter Sunday, which falls on April 5. The feast day commemorates Jesus Christ's triumphant entry into Jerusalem, according to Baylor University.Local churches will observe Palm Sunday with blessed palm branches, often woven into crosses, symbolizing peace, victory and eternal life, according to the Catholic Archdiocese of Miami. The sacramental palms can be kept at home and returned to church or nature, but should not to be thrown away, the Archdiocese noted.",
